%% Both APIs share one service, one Redis cache and one database.
flowchart LR
  APP[Mobile app · or Postman] -->|POST /graphql| GQL[Apollo server · GraphQL]
  GQL --> RES[ProductsResolver · GraphQL]
  RES --> DL[DataLoader · per request]
  DL --> SVC[CatalogService · shared logic]
  APP -->|GET /v1| REST[REST controllers · NestJS]
  REST --> SVC
  SVC -->|1 check| REDIS[(Redis · cache 60s)]
  REDIS -->|2 on miss| DB[(Database · SQL)]
